# UI-session scratch (never commit): SIM dev DB + throwaway scripts
# ⚠️ The pattern, not just the one name. Every session that needs its own instance
# names its own DB (ui-dev.db, eggload-dev.db, ...), and this repo is PUBLIC — a
# session DB carries a family, its kids and their labels. One that does not match a
# listed name shows up as an untracked file next to the ones being committed.
*-dev.db
*-dev.db-*
scratch-*.ts

# ⚠️ UPLOADED MEDIA — REAL PHOTOS OF REAL CHILDREN, AND THIS REPO IS PUBLIC.
# routes/media.ts defaults MEDIA_DIR to "data/media", i.e. inside the working tree,
# so any dev or prod run drops kid-uploaded photo stickers here. Nothing under data/
# has ever been on main, but it was not ignored either — one `git add -A` in a
# worktree that had served an upload was all it took, and that already happened on a
# branch (a jpg under data/media/2026/07/). Ignored, not merely untracked.
data/
cashlink-recovery.jsonl

# Sound generation scratch. tools/sound/gen-timer-sounds.py writes every take here --
# 48 reminder clips across four voices plus the raw pre-trim mp3s. Samples are review
# artefacts, not assets: what ships is copied into public/kid/timer/sfx/ deliberately,
# after somebody has listened to it. Regenerate, don't commit.
tools/sound/out/
